% What lesson 3's default rule should say.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/tweety.dl --expect programs/tweety.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/tweety.dl --expect programs/tweety.expect

flies(tweety).           % a bird, and nothing says otherwise
abnormal(opus).          % a penguin
:- flies(opus).
:- abnormal(tweety).
